1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,939
Spotify to MP3.

2
00:00:01,989 --> 00:00:06,070
Spotify links in, tagged MP3 files out.

3
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:11,457
Want a Spotify track as
an MP3 file you can keep?

4
00:00:12,866 --> 00:00:15,172
Paste the track link and click Load.

5
00:00:15,222 --> 00:00:19,886
The app reads the title, artist, and
length from Spotify's public pages.

6
00:00:21,696 --> 00:00:22,761
Pick a quality.

7
00:00:22,811 --> 00:00:25,886
128 kilobits per second keeps files small.

8
00:00:25,936 --> 00:00:28,936
Files are saved to the folder shown here.

9
00:00:30,345 --> 00:00:31,635
Click Download.

10
00:00:31,685 --> 00:00:36,638
The app finds a matching
version on YouTube with yt-dlp,

11
00:00:36,688 --> 00:00:41,105
converts it to MP3 with
FFmpeg, and adds the tags.

12
00:00:45,567 --> 00:00:47,781
And here is the file in Explorer.

13
00:00:47,831 --> 00:00:51,487
Named by artist and title,
tagged, with the cover art.

14
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,311
No Spotify sign-in needed.

15
00:00:56,361 --> 00:01:00,116
This is an independent
app, not made by Spotify.

16
00:01:00,166 --> 00:01:02,890
Use it only for music you may save.

